  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Stream Crash and Viewer Reaction</h2>\n<p>During the stream, PC-kun became unresponsive, and the streamer attributed the crash to Elden Ring. The streamer then questioned whether to continue the stream or move to the next one, indicating uncertainty about the situation.</p>\n<h2>Gratitude and Closure</h2>\n<p>The streamer expressed gratitude to the viewers for watching and hoped they enjoyed the stream. They also mentioned that viewers had experienced a significant amount of content during the session.</p>\n<p>The streamer promised to defeat an opponent in a future stream, even if it took multiple attempts. They concluded the stream by expressing sadness and bidding farewell to the viewers.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FhlbZqFBpfI</p>",
